<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. WINS FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. WINS FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States clinched the 1996 Fed Cup on Sunday by taking an unbeatable 3-0 lead over Spain in the best-of-five tie.</p>
</text>
